      "name": "Blood Drain",
      "sort": 400000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The giant tick is attached to a creature</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The giant tick uses its hypostome to drain blood from the creature it's attached to. This deals [[/r 1d4]] damage, and the giant tick gains temporary Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. A creature that has its blood drained by a giant tick is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} until it receives healing (of any kind or amount).</p>"
        },
